んのアシスタントでマァヤ的に心がけていることは何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんみんには気全然使わないし自分の私でいられる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんの助手って何するの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手当てもらえるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特になにもしない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にケラケラ笑ってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手当て？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんみんからお手当てなんて貰わないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ答えられてない質問あるんですけど容量がいっぱいでかけません(涙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またかきますSorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日かずみんみんが私が真夏の格好してる！って言って！写真とられた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blogのせてね！っていわれたのでのせます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私が履いてる靴はトマトのです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/17/4904024/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"}],"source":"archive"}